Ok, A.V has the right idea, but here are some details.

You have to work your way back to the stairs where you entered the level.
This will entail many useless encounters with the demon along the way.  You
might get lucky and kill him, but you really don't have the artifact to do
that.  Grayswandir probably would have done the job on the first or second
encounter.

Once you get close to the upstair you need to use this tatic.  Stop two
steps from the stairs and wait until he teleports next to you.  If he
teleports into the space between you and the stairs, step away... otherwise
you might chase him up stairs and have to start all over again on the level
above.  If he teleports on the other side, move onto the upstair.  With
speedboots and intrinsic fast you can get there ahead of him.  Once you are
on the upstair he will stand up and fight you to the death.

